Permanently delete an artist's catalogue, or a single release from it. If the artist is credited on other artists' tracks, those credits are removed too - warned before confirming.

Usage: delete [OPTIONS] <ARTIST|--release <RELEASE>>

Arguments:
  [ARTIST]  Artist name(s), separated by ';' for multiple (case-insensitive exact match)

Options:
      --release <RELEASE>  Delete a single release (LocalRelease id) instead of a whole artist - the rest of the artist's catalogue is left untouched
      --y                  Skip confirmation prompt
      --files              Also delete the audio files from disk (only paths inside MUSIC_DIR)
      --dry-run            Show what would be deleted without changing anything
  -h, --help               Print help
